  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/05/RitaEstherHerrerosSola1.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 640px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(75, 79, 86); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(241, 240, 240);\">(12 fotos) Rita Esther herreros Sol&aacute;, de Onda, modelo de fotograf&iacute;a y pasarela, es candidata al certamen de belleza a nivel internacional Miss &amp;Mister Mediterr&aacute;neo Global 2018, representando a la provincia de Teruel, despu&eacute;s de haber ganado el concurso correspondiente.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ritaestherherrerossolamiss/ritaestherherrerossola1.jpg\" alt=\"ritaestherherrerossola1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ritaestherherrerossolamiss/ritaestherherrerossola10.jpg\" alt=\"ritaestherherrerossola10\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ritaestherherrerossolamiss/ritaestherherrerossola11.png\" alt=\"ritaestherherrerossola11\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ritaestherherrerossolamiss/ritaestherherrerossola12.png\" alt=\"ritaestherherrerossola12\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ritaestherherrerossolamiss/ritaestherherrerossola2.jpg\" alt=\"ritaestherherrerossola2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ritaestherherrerossolamiss/ritaestherherrerossola3.jpg\" alt=\"ritaestherherrerossola3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ritaestherherrerossolamiss/ritaestherherrerossola4.jpg\"